lemma PayrollS (C:ℕ→ CoinsR P)(k:ℕ)(e:26+k ≤ m)(w:LowSν*Fintype.card I< k)(l:List I)(h:PolesR l) (x:DiagramR I)(v:ℕ→I→ Cover)(ha:Tendsto (fun i=> RecessS P m (L i) (v i)) atTop (𝓝 x))(p':x∈ CardsR I)(he:∀ᶠ i in atTop, AskR P (CountersS P m (L i) (v i))∈ MasksR I) : Tendsto (fun i=> SπR (C i).porch (TapeI p B0 M pu A D m u S V X' R L0 (L i)) (AskR P (CountersS P m (L i) (v i)))- (C i).cash (SportR P m (L i)) (l.map (fun k=> StageμS D m (L i) (X' k) (v i k))).prod) atTop (𝓝 0):=by
 let f(i:ℕ):=AutoPadR P (L i); let V'(i:ℕ):ℝ:= StallJ P (f i); let d(i:ℕ):= deltaR P (L i); let y(i:ℕ):=RecessS P m (L i) (v i)
 have hx:Tendsto (fun i=>4*(V' i/d i)) atTop (𝓝 0):=by
     have ht:Tendsto (fun i=>V' i/d i) atTop (𝓝 0):=(R_fit P).comp pL; simpa using ht.const_mul 4
 obtain ⟨j,l',g,H'₀⟩:=OnCardS x p' y ha _ hx; rw [Metric.tendsto_nhds]; intro ε hxE
 filter_upwards [H'₀,pL.eventually (SlipS_R p B0 M pu A D Q t u' H m u S V X' R L0 H' k e w l h ε hxE),he] with i r k v'
 rw[dist_zero_right]; apply k _ _ j l' (poles_permR h g) v'
 let q:=pL; have hp:0<d i:=deltaR_good ..; have hw:BuntR (d i*(4*(V' i/d i))) j l' (AskR P (CountersS P m (L i) (v i))):= SpinOrdersS _ _ j _ _ _ r hp.le (RadarS P m (L i) (v i)).symm -- arg order
 rw [show d i*(4*(V' i/d i))=4*V' i by field_simp] at hw
 exact (hikeπR P.publicH _ _ l' (V' i) hw (σ:=fun _:I=>f i) (fun _=> le_rfl) (fun _=>0) (f i).2).1 -- tune
